will be held on Monday, May 5.  Charlie and I thoroughly enjoy this=20
event, and we hope that you come.  We will start at 9:30 a.m., break for=20
about 15 minutes at noon (food will be available - but at a price, of=20
course), and then continue talking to hard-core attendees until at least=20
3:30.  Last year we had representatives from all 50 states, as well as=20
Australia, Greece, Israel, Portugal, Singapore, Sweden, Switzerland, and=20
the United Kingdom.  The annual meeting is a time for owners to get their=
=20
business-related questions answered, and therefore Charlie and I will=20
